    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present 7 Beverton Close, Donabate, Co. Dublin, to the open market. This very well presented three bedroom semi detached family home is set on a quiet cul-de-sac within this mature and sought after development.\n\nAccommodation comprises welcoming entrance hall, guest Wc, lounge, separate dining room, spacious fitted kitchen/dining. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms including a master bedroom with en suite and a modern, refitted family bathroom.\n\nWalled garden to front with large cobblelock driveway, lawned area, off-street parking for two cars and mature trees and shrubbery. Side entrance leads to spacious private walled rear garden, with lawned area, mature trees, patio and concrete garden shed. \n\n7 Beverton Close is just a 5 minute walk to the beautiful Newbridge Demense, encompassing 370 acres of historic parkland including Newbridge House and Farm and a large children's playground. It is only a 10 minute walk to Donabate Train Station.\n\nDonabate enjoys easy access to a host of local shopping, leisure facilities, the beautiful Donabate beach, local schools and creches and Donabate train station. A vibrant and family friendly town, it has a welcoming and supportive local community. \n\nThe development is well serviced by public transport with several Dublin bus routes available close by. The M1, M50, and Dublin Airport are also all easily accessible. 7 Beverton Close is an ideal family home in a superb location and must be viewed to be fully appreciated."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.45m x 1.70m\nWood flooring, coat rack and stairs to first floor landing\n\nGuest Wc - 1.50m x 1.10m\nWc, wash hand basin with underneath storage, partly tiled walls and tiled floor.\n\nLounge - 5.45m x 3.60m\nFeature fireplace with open fire, wood flooring, coving on ceiling, and built in shelving unit. Double glazed bay window to front and double doors to dining room.\n\nDining Room - 4.10m x 2.75m\nWood flooring, built in storage unit and double glazed doors to rear garden.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 5.80m x 2.50m\nShaker style fitted kitchen with ample range of wall and floor units, worktop, tiled splashback, integrated electric oven, hob and extractor fan, integrated fridge freezer and dishwasher, tiled floor. Recessed spotlights. Double glazed windows to rear and side.\n\nUPSTAIRS - \n\n\nLanding - 2.70m x 2.0m\nHot press, access to attic and frosted double glazed window to side.\n\nMain Bedroom - 3.85m x 3.25m\nBuilt in wardrobes, wood flooring, and double glazed window to rear.\n\nEn Suite - 2.0m x 1.50m\nComprising shower, Wc, wash hand basin with underneath storage, wall mounted mirror. Tiled floor. Double glazed window to rear.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.75m x 2.95m\nBuilt in wardrobes, built in shelving unit, wood flooring. Double glazed window to front.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.10m x 2.30m\nBuilt in wardrobes, shelving unit, and double glazed window to front.\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.05m x 2.0m\nModern re-fitted bathroom comprising bath with shower, Wc, wash hand basin, heated towel rail. Partly tiled walls and tiled floor. Frosted double glazed window to side aspect.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Semi detached family residence</li><li>Quiet cul de sac location</li><li>Mature and sought after development in Donabate</li><li>House Alarm</li><li>Guest Wc</li><li>Spacious lounge</li><li>Separate dining room</li><li>Excellent fitted kitchen/dining</li><li>Three bedrooms</li><li>En suite</li><li>Modern family bathroom</li><li>Driveway parking for two cars to front</li><li>Private walled rear garden</li><li>Easy access to leisure, shopping and transport amenities</li><li>No onward chain</ul>"
      },
